    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Sit comfortably and tap Start.\n\nWatch the mind. While there is silence \u2014 do nothing. The level rises on its own: each next one lasts twice as long.\n\nAs soon as a thought appears \u2014 tap Thought. The session will end, and you will see the level you reached.\n\nThe goal is to stay in silence as long as possible."
